娘NTRがハチャメチャにえっちだったため、娘NTR的なシチュをご依頼させていただきたいです。\nまた、長く同作品を楽しませていただいているため、可能であれば本編6章後に学園がどうなっていったのかや主人公がSNOを使って学園以外でどんな事をしたのかが想像できるような描写や情景が一文でもあると嬉しいです。\n\n細かい流れや進行については葉原先生の筆が乗りやすい形で進めていただければと思います。ハードなシチュもいちゃいちゃNTRシチュもどっちも大好きです！\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 40, "word_count": 6842, "transcoder": "text", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 33256, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "じゃんた", "screen_name": "janta44", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1588171625127903232/ips2oFeo.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/77458338/1650878933/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 44773, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "青空S男", "screen_name": "s_oam10", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1546965517684322305/gWsgs4x6.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1546962448330428416/1663916471/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 526725, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "kone🔞Skeb募集中", "screen_name": "IdaleeKone", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1982358977951195136/3KGqPOP5.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1274363389490290688/1760724609/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "delet